DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261129T060001
DTSTAMP:20261126T194447Z
UID:0133147d6701f28a@nerdhang
CATEGORIES:museum
DESCRIPTION:<b>Spend Thanksgiving weekend at the Museum! Learn about NASA'
 s Voyager spacecraft\, enjoy a free hands-on craft activity\, and take in 
 a planetarium show.</b> Friday - Sunday\, November 27 - 29 Museum Hours: 1
 0 am - 5 pm Activity: 12 pm - 4 pm <b>Celebrating Voyager</b> This Novembe
 r\, NASA's Voyager 1 reaches a remarkable milestone\, traveling more than 
 one light-day from Earth! Launched in 1977\, Voyager 1 has traveled beyond
  our solar system into interstellar space and is now the most distant huma
 \n\nSource: Cradle of Aviation Museum\n\nhttps://www.cradleofaviation.org/
GEO:40.7271175;-73.6044605
LOCATION:Cradle of Aviation Museum\, Charles Lindbergh Blvd\, Garden City
 \, NY 11530
URL:https://www.cradleofaviation.org/
END:VEVENT
